# ============================================================================
# This repository is a DEPLOYMENT. Every file must arrive on the server byte for
# byte identical to what the build produced.
#
# `* -text` disables end-of-line conversion entirely, in both directions. Without
# it, git on Windows stores LF and rewrites to CRLF in the working tree, and any
# file it misdetects as text — a `.node` addon, a `.dll`, a font, a WASM blob —
# is silently altered. `node_modules` here contains an 18 MB `libvips-42.dll` and
# several compiled binaries, and a corrupted one fails at require time on the
# server with an error that says nothing about line endings.
#
# There is no reason to want conversion here. Nobody edits these files; they are
# build output.
* -text
